{"chunk_id": "ecd12d6f4293", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "2025年8月9日", "text": "宇树科技创始人王兴兴在接受《科创板日报》等媒体采访时表示，未来几年，每年全行业人形机器人出货量每年翻番都是有保证的，如果有更大的技术突破，甚至可能未来2~3年突然一年出货几十万台，甚至上百万台也有可能。\n王兴兴还表示，未来2-5年智能机器人技术的重心，是统一、端到端智能机器人大模型，更低成本、更高寿命的硬件，超大批量的制造，以及低成本、大规模算力。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "ecd12d6f4293", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "e13d813a70af", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "2025年8月7日", "text": "①银河通用首个“银河太空舱”正式营业，作为以“机器人店员+迷你店铺”为核心的可复制零售业态，它能在9㎡的空间内实现全天候自主运营，为用户提供饮品、小食、文创、药品等高频消费品；单舱预计日均服务2000人次、承接500单订单。据悉，这也是全球首个城市级、常态化运营的人形机器人示范区落地海淀。\n②全球首家具身智能机器人4S店——Robot Mall将于8月8日正式营业。与汽车的4S店相似，这家机器人4S店同样集机器人“销售（Sale）、零配件供应（Sparepart）、售后服务（Service）、信息反馈（Survey）”等功能于一体。目前，4S店依托机器人大世界现有空间展开，共设四层，面积4000平方米，集合了全国40多家厂商的50多款机器人产品，涵盖北京人形机器人创新中心“天工”、优必选Walker S、宇树G1等人形机器人产品。\n相关介绍\n马斯克明确2026年初启动Optimus量产，计划5年内实现年产100万台，单台需200+个MIM零件（如灵巧手关节、传感器外壳），预计2030年将创造20亿美元MIM市场空间。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "e13d813a70af", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "b3d08a7300cf", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "机器人轻量化重要性", "date_hint": "", "text": "机器人轻量化是当前人形机器人产业发展的核心趋势，旨在通过材料创新、结构优化和先进工艺降低机器人自重，从而提升运动性能、续航能力及场景适应性。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "b3d08a7300cf", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "6ba24b6a989b", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "续航瓶颈突破​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "当前人形机器人平均续航仅2小时（如特斯拉Optimus Gen 1），而减重10kg可使续航提升30%以上。以特斯拉Optimus Gen 2为例，通过轻量化设计减重10kg至63kg，步行速度提升30%。轻量化直接降低电机负载和能耗，类比新能源汽车：减重20%可降低能耗15%。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "6ba24b6a989b", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "73f8b24bccc9", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "运动性能提升​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "自重过大会增加运动惯性，导致关节磨损、动作迟滞。轻量化设计（如波士顿动力Atlas）通过降低转动惯量，显著提升动态响应速度和灵活性，使其能完成跑酷、后空翻等高敏捷动作。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "73f8b24bccc9", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "32cb408aab71", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "安全与场景拓展​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "轻量化机器人（如家庭服务机器人）碰撞时对人体的伤害更小，且更适应太空探索、医疗手术等对重量敏感的场景。例如，手术机器人减重后可降低医生操作负担，提升手术精度。\n二、机器人轻量化路径1. 材料优化：高性能替代传统金属​", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "32cb408aab71", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "8f6bd4e82936", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "安全与场景拓展​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "PEEK材料：比强度高、耐磨耐腐蚀，为“以塑代钢”首选。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "8f6bd4e82936", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "e33d9b853a4a", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "安全与场景拓展​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "镁合金：密度仅1.74g/cm³（铝的2/3），散热性、减震性优异。​\n碳纤维复合材料：强度为钢的16倍，密度仅1/4，应用于承力结构（如Optimus手臂减重70%）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "e33d9b853a4a", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "a6a3092870a7", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "安全与场景拓展​​", "date_hint": "", "text": "2、工艺革新：3D打印与精密成型​​金属3D打印：制造复杂内部结构，实现材料精准分布（如Figure机器人定制关节）。\nMIM金属注射成型：批量生产精密小型零件，成本降低30%（特斯拉灵巧手采用该工艺）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a6a3092870a7", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
